 "title": "12 V uni-directional ESD and surge protection diode pair, 60 pF, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.1",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Two uni-directional TVS diodes in a SOT-23, cathodes on pins 1 and 2 and a shared anode on pin 3, so one package guards two lines against ground. Each line stands off 12 V, breaks down between 13.3 V and 16 V at 1 mA, and clamps at no more than 27.6 V while carrying a 16 A 8/20 µs surge. It withstands ±30 kV ESD to IEC 61000-4-2 in both air and contact discharge, with 60 pF typical capacitance. Uses listed include handsets and their accessories, PDAs, notebooks and handhelds, portable instruments, set-top boxes, servers and desktop PCs.",
